{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b3eb2bc005b2b1ad","name":"Medical Suite","source":{"id":"source:reference-b3eb2bc005b2b1ad","title":"Medical Suite","revision":18752,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:40:20Z","sha256":"dece8526d961e44d9a93c0442cd1e156fffaa280437fd1f3e2bd913d073f4524","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18752","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Medical%20Suite&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b3eb2bc005b2b1ad","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Points"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size Restriction:"]}," Colossal or Larger\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,000 (Base)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Medical Suite, which can be installed on ships of Colossal size or larger, provides the necessary facilities to maintain the health of a crew over a long period. A Medical Suite includes (Starship's Size Modifier)/5 medical beds and (Starship's Size Modifier)/50 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bacta Tanks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bacta_Tanks"},". (A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," may combine multiple Medical Suites when determining the facilities available.) When a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," can't accommodate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bacta Tank"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bacta_Tank","referenceId":"reference:3bce722dd2724c30"},", a medical bed is usually sufficient to stabilize a patient.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A medical bed contains monitoring equipment to keep track of vital signs and the medical gear needed to deal with most common injuries and illnesses. Treat a medical bed as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medpac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medpac","referenceId":"reference:f89e0de3ab0ae989"}," (10 uses, with a single charge costing as much as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medpac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medpac","referenceId":"reference:f89e0de3ab0ae989"},"), a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medical Kit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medical_Kit","referenceId":"reference:6880b06746719e0b"},", and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgery Kit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgery_Kit","referenceId":"reference:bd02287b55bbce4e"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
